5 691 M
(Where in the Bible does it say the apostolic church had practices like salutes, drills, uniforms, ) s
5 678 M
(and marching such as Pathfinders and AY clubs do?) s
5 652 M
(It does not. The apostolic church does not show salutes, drills, uniforms, or marching ) s
5 639 M
(\342\\200\\224 and it also does not show cooking demonstrations, health lectures, or medical cadet ) s
5 626 M
(corps. Absence in the New Testament is not by itself a prohibition. As long as a practice does ) s
5 613 M
(not contradict what the New Testament church did and is ordered toward the church's mission, ) s
5 600 M
(the church is free to adopt it.) s
5 574 M
(Pathfinders and the youth clubs work as auxiliary organizations. They give young people ) s
5 561 M
(constructive outlets for enormous energy, teach discipline, order, cleanliness, and cooperation, ) s
5 548 M
(draw families into the church through their children, and retain members over the long term. In ) s
5 535 M
(some parts of the world, like Panama's Mission Caleb, Pathfinders in uniform paint houses, cut ) s
5 522 M
(grass, and clean communities.) s
5 496 M
