5 483 M
(that become pure entertainment, local programs that have absorbed worldly practices. That is a ) s
5 470 M
(real problem and it needs to be corrected. But misuse of a program does not invalidate the ) s
5 457 M
(program. If the local leadership is biblically sound and following the actual curriculum, the club ) s
5 444 M
(is a benefit to the youth and to the church. If it is drifting, it needs to be pulled back in love, not ) s
5 431 M
(thrown out.) s
5 405 M
