5 392 M
(an elder who has stopped responding to emails will respond?) s
5 366 M
(No. Tell the truth. Leave the consequences with God.) s
5 340 M
(The prophet's disguise in 1 Kings 20 is not a permission slip. Scripture describes many things it ) s
5 327 M
(does not endorse. The Gibeonites tricked Israel and saved their lives, but ended up as slaves ) s
5 314 M
(forever \342\\200\\224 the trick is narrated, not commended. The prophet in 1 Kings 20 was given a ) s
5 301 M
(specific, prophetic instruction to confront Ahab in a particular way at a particular moment. You ) s
5 288 M
(have not been given that instruction. Lifting the narrative out as a general license for deception ) s
5 275 M
(is the same kind of mishandling that produced the doctrine of baptism for the dead from 1 ) s
5 262 M
(Corinthians 15:29, where Paul is only describing what some were doing, not prescribing it.) s
