5 158 M
(exist until 1844? How do we reconcile the rending of the earthly veil at the cross with Christ's ) s
5 145 M
(two-phase priestly ministry in heaven?) s
5 119 M
(The rending of the veil at Christ's death signified the end of the earthly sanctuary system, not ) s
5 106 M
