(the death of the Son of God; it did not collapse the sequential ministry Christ was about to ) s
5 665 M
(begin in heaven.) s
5 639 M
(Who served as the high priest in the heavenly sanctuary before Jesus's inauguration as our high ) s
5 626 M
(priest at His ascension?) s
5 600 M
(Strictly speaking, no one served as a fully inaugurated high priest before Christ, because the ) s
5 587 M
(blood of bulls and goats could not actually remove sin. In the Old Testament, God passed over ) s
