(High Priest, He had to meet specific qualifications: He had to become human, experience our ) s
5 496 M
(weaknesses, and offer a real, effective sacrifice for sin, which is the point made in Hebrews 5. ) s
5 483 M
(Only after dying on the cross could He ascend to heaven with His own blood to formally anoint ) s
5 470 M
(the heavenly sanctuary, in line with Daniel 9:24, and be inaugurated as our High Priest, turning ) s
