5 652 M
(whichever god's people won was believed to be the stronger god, so when Israel was mocked ) s
5 639 M
(and attacked, God's name itself was at stake.) s
5 613 M
(Moab is a good example of timing. When Israel first passed through on the way to the Jordan, ) s
5 600 M
(God told Moses not to fight Moab, Edom, or Ammon \342\\200\\224 they were kin through Lot and ) s
5 587 M
(Abraham, and their cup was not yet full. Later those same nations hardened further, and only ) s
5 574 M
(then do we see the wars of 2 Kings 3 and others.) s
5 548 M
(Nations can commit the unpardonable sin, just as individuals can. Babylon was told, "You have ) s
5 535 M
(been weighed in the balances and found wanting." At the end, the wicked themselves will ask ) s
5 522 M
(to be destroyed because they cannot stand to live in the presence of the God they have learned ) s
5 509 M
(to despise. God is simply giving them the full result of the choice they have been making. That ) s
5 496 M
(is the frame for Old Testament holy war: divine patience first, judgment only when the line has ) s
5 483 M
(been crossed, and the choice always respected.) s
5 457 M
(If wars seem fewer now than in Old Testament times, what did Jesus mean in Matthew 24 about ) s
5 444 M
(wars and rumors of wars as a sign of the end?) s
5 418 M
(The sign is not that there are wars for the first time. Wars have always existed. What Jesus is ) s
5 405 M
(describing is a convergence \342\\200\\224 wars on a worldwide scale, more bloody, more ) s
5 392 M
(repetitive, combined with all the other signs.) s
5 366 M
(Matthew 24 does not begin with wars. It begins with deception \342\\200\\224 false Christs, ) s
5 353 M
(counterfeit spiritual manifestations, angels pretending to be Christ. When those deceptions rise, ) s
5 340 M
(the other signs \342\\200\\224 wars, pestilences, earthquakes \342\\200\\224 are already being fulfilled, ) s
5 327 M
(but now in greater intensity and frequency. The First and Second World Wars are a pattern the ) s
5 314 M
(ancient world never saw. Old Testament wars were regional, largely confined to Asia and later ) s
5 301 M
(Europe. Today the contest is global, with the major powers drawing the nations into their ) s
5 288 M
(alignment.) s
5 262 M
(And Matthew 24 is not the only list. Revelation adds the ascent of the United States in global ) s
5 249 M
(power, the healing of the wound of the papacy, and more. Ellen White observes in The Great ) s
5 236 M
(Controversy \(pages 589-590\) that the disasters God allows will become more frequent and more ) s
5 223 M
(severe as the end nears. It is the accumulation \342\\200\\224 wars, natural disasters, social unrest, ) s
5 210 M
(deceptions, political and religious realignments \342\\200\\224 all intensifying at the same time that ) s
5 197 M
(constitutes the sign. That is the perfect storm Jesus is pointing at, not any single war in isolation.) s
5 171 M
(Why did Ellen White call the 1888 message "the third angel's message in verity," and if it had ) s
5 158 M
(been accepted at Minneapolis would it have brought the latter rain and finished the work?) s
5 132 M
(Yes. Had the message been received, it would have brought the latter rain and finished the ) s
5 119 M
(work.) s
5 93 M
(The reason Ellen White called the 1888 message the third angel's message in verity is that it ) s
5 80 M
(restored the missing half of Revelation 14:12. The third angel ends with, "Here is the patience of ) s
5 67 M
(the saints; here are they that keep the commandments of God and the faith of Jesus." Adventism ) s
5 54 M
(had dwelt heavily on the commandments of God, but had not preached the faith of Jesus with ) s
5 41 M
(the same weight. Salvation had been drifting toward works. At Minneapolis, the older pioneers ) s
5 28 M
(accused Jones and Waggoner of undermining the law. Ellen White's response was the opposite: ) s
5 15 M
(they were giving the law its right place by putting the faith of Jesus back where it belonged, ) s
5 2 M
(because it is through the faith of Jesus that the commandments of God are kept.) s
