(forever. That is where God's promise to wipe away the tear becomes an erasure, not a ) s
5 353 M
(suppression. The pain of who is not there is borne eternally in the heart of God, not in ours.) s
5 327 M
(Ellen White was shown this in vision. In Early Writings page 17 she was carried forward to the ) s
5 314 M
(kingdom and met two of the 1844 pioneers who had died, Fitch and Stockman, who asked what ) s
