5 184 M
(The premise behind the question does not hold up, and the speakers say so directly. They do ) s
5 171 M
(not see how the Filioque is connected to supplanting Christ with the pope.) s
5 145 M
(What the Filioque actually is: the Latin word filioque means "and from the Son." The original ) s
5 132 M
(creed said the Holy Spirit proceeds from the Father. Later the Western church added "and the ) s
5 119 M
(Son," so that the Spirit proceeds from the Father and the Son. The Eastern church did not accept ) s
5 106 M
(that addition and considered it a corruption of the doctrine of the Godhead. That dispute was ) s
5 93 M
(one of the major factors in the schism between the Eastern and Western churches. It is a serious ) s
5 80 M
(theological and ecclesial controversy in its own right, but it is not the mechanism by which the ) s
5 67 M
(papacy substitutes itself for Christ.) s
5 41 M
