5 548 M
(faithfully observe the seventh-day Sabbath until Saturday sundown.) s
5 522 M
(What is the SDA Church\342\\200\\231s position on White Christian Nationalism?) s
5 496 M
(The Seventh-day Adventist Church is completely against Christian nationalism. Any ideology ) s
5 483 M
(that attempts to merge church and state to create a "Christian nation" or use political authority ) s
5 470 M
(to enforce religion is entirely antithetical to Adventist theology and core values. ) s
5 444 M
(The church\342\\200\\231s historical and official stance mandates a strict separation of church and ) s
5 431 M
(state. The church and its representatives will not align with any political party, nor will they use ) s
5 418 M
(civil influence to advance their faith or inhibit the faith of others. True moral change cannot be ) s
5 405 M
(achieved through legislation or political force; it only comes through the work of the Holy Spirit ) s
5 392 M
(in the human heart.) s
5 366 M
(Furthermore, leading any movement with racial designations like "white" or "black" introduces ) s
5 353 M
(an artificial, demonic division into the human family. God is no respecter of persons. When ) s
5 340 M
(believers divest themselves of the desire for superiority, these racial divisions lose their power. ) s
5 327 M
(The church's mandate is to preach the gospel to all people, not to seize the levers of government ) s
5 314 M
(to enforce a national religion.) s
5 288 M
