5 704 M
(there is nowhere outside His knowledge, reach, and government, not that God is physically ) s
5 691 M
(spread through every corner of creation.) s
5 665 M
(On that basis, the Father remains enthroned in heaven, Christ remains in heaven interceding, ) s
5 652 M
(and the Holy Spirit works on earth through the ministry of angels. The centurion's servant ) s
5 639 M
(illustrates the principle: authority can act effectively at a distance through delegated agents. In ) s
