5 509 M
(Does Armageddon happen before or after the Millennium?) s
5 483 M
(Armageddon, strictly speaking, takes place before the second coming, not after the millennium.) s
5 457 M
(The plagues are before the second coming, and Armageddon is tied to the sixth and seventh ) s
5 444 M
(plagues. The sixth plague is the preparation for the battle, and the seventh plague is the battle ) s
5 431 M
(itself when Christ comes with the armies of heaven. In that setting, the battle is the wicked ) s
5 418 M
(gathering against God's people. Because God's people represent Him, it is a battle against God ) s
5 405 M
(in the person of His people.) s
5 379 M
(So Armageddon is not the post-millennial attack on the New Jerusalem. It is the pre-advent ) s
5 366 M
(crisis in which the powers of earth unite against the remnant under the last-plague setting, and ) s
5 353 M
(God's people are delivered before Christ appears.) s
5 327 M
(An important distinction still has to be kept in view. After the millennium, Satan does gather ) s
5 314 M
(the wicked around the city. He deceives them, rallies them, and prepares them to attack the ) s
5 301 M
(New Jerusalem. In that sense, there is a pattern after the millennium that resembles what ) s
5 288 M
(happened before the second coming. The multitudes had already turned against the harlot and ) s
5 275 M
(the religious leaders before the advent, and after the millennium they finally turn against Satan ) s
5 262 M
(himself when the true history is displayed and his deception is exposed.) s
5 236 M
(That resemblance is what causes confusion. What happens after the millennium can be spoken ) s
5 223 M
(of loosely as a second stage or parallel to Armageddon. But technically speaking, Armageddon ) s
5 210 M
(is before the second coming, when the deceived wicked turn against the religious powers and ) s
5 197 M
(move against God's people under the sixth and seventh plagues.) s
5 171 M
(So if the question is asked precisely, Armageddon belongs to the closing conflict before Christ ) s
5 158 M
(returns. The post-millennial assault on the city is real, but it should be distinguished from ) s
5 145 M
(Armageddon proper.) s
5 119 M
(Is it wrong to show physical affection \342\\200\\224 stroking, holding \342\\200\\224 during church ) s
5 106 M
(service, and how should people conduct themselves in the house of God?) s
5 80 M
