5 691 M
(of non-Israelites?) s
5 665 M
(Biblical slavery cannot be equated with Greco-Roman slavery or modern colonial slavery. Those ) s
5 652 M
(later systems treated human beings as mere property to be exploited with "rigor"\342\\200\\224the ) s
5 639 M
(exact kind of abusive bondage Israel suffered in Egypt, which God condemned. In fact, God ) s
5 626 M
(punished the United States for the high crime of slavery.) s
5 600 M
