(argues you must work the layered structure: Daniel 2 is the foundation; Daniel 7 expands it; ) s
5 470 M
(Revelation 12 expands further; Revelation 13 builds on 12; Revelation 17 is the final and fullest ) s
5 457 M
(expansion. The waters the harlot sits on in Revelation 17 parallel the dragon's flood in ) s
5 444 M
(Revelation 12 \342\\200\\224 the same persecuting power at different stages of history. Only when ) s
5 431 M
(you see that building pattern does the placement of "five have fallen" make sense \342\\200\\224 ) s
5 418 M
