5 93 M
(Scripture.) s
5 67 M
(1 Corinthians 10:16 asks, "Is it not the communion of the blood of Christ... the communion of ) s
5 54 M
(the body of Christ?" The word is communion \342\\200\\224 participation, memorial identification ) s
5 41 M
(\342\\200\\224 not literalized flesh and blood. 1 Corinthians 11:27-29 warns against eating "in an ) s
5 28 M
(unworthy manner" and "not discerning the Lord's body." The unworthiness in context is about ) s
5 15 M
(self-examination, unconfessed sin, and failing to grasp what the symbols represent \342\\200\\224 ) s
5 2 M
(not about failing to chew literal flesh.) s
