5 691 M
(John 6 is the decisive passage. When Jesus said "unless you eat my flesh and drink my blood, ) s
5 678 M
(you have no life in you," many disciples heard it literally and were offended. He clarified in ) s
5 665 M
(verse 63: "It is the spirit who gives life; the flesh profits nothing. The words that I speak to you ) s
5 652 M
(are spirit and they are life." Physical eating is explicitly not what he meant. He means receiving ) s
