(to Christ, Romans 6:14-16 declares that sin no longer has dominion, and 2 Corinthians 5:17 ) s
5 366 M
(confirms that former things pass away \342\\200\\224 the power of sin is broken. This progressive ) s
5 353 M
(freedom from sin's power, and eventually its presence, is the biblical shape of deliverance.) s
