(Revelation 13:16-17 states plainly that no one may buy or sell except those who bear the mark of ) s
5 119 M
(the beast. The restriction is literal: commerce will be closed to those who refuse the mark. But ) s
5 106 M
(the question of why \342\\200\\224 the spiritual condition that triggers the literal consequence ) s
5 93 M
(\342\\200\\224 is what Proverbs 23:23 unlocks.) s
